    "summary": "**LEAGUES OF VOTANN** units in your army lack the [Hostile Acquisition](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) and [Fortify Takeover](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) abilities except through this rule. They begin the battle with Hostile Acquisition. As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, you may spend 3YP to switch all of them from Hostile Acquisition to Fortify Takeover, or back again.",
